00:17:53.590 --> 00:17:56.230
so that in any given

00:17:56.310 --> 00:18:00.070
office there will be a maximum of one employee working.

00:18:00.630 --> 00:18:05.510
If you're going into somebody else's office you're expected to wear a mask

00:18:07.135 --> 00:18:18.095
and the goal is to you know minimize direct contact between employees so when we do get one of them that tests positive for COVID it doesn't wipe out the whole office

00:18:18.255 --> 00:18:20.175
